{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Dragon Half","Mink&mdash;the daughter of a dragon and a retired dragonslaying knight&mdash;sets out on a journey to get tickets for a concert held by Dick Saucer, world-famous teen idol and dragon hunter. Meanwhile, the corrupt king of the land is trying to take her hostage to get at her mother, and his magic-using daughter seeks to foil Mink's quest out of sheer spite.\n\n\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"],"ja":["ドラゴンハーフ",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-870","ids":{"shikimori":870,"mal":870,"anilist":870,"kodik":"serial-65635"},"kodikIds":["serial-23840","serial-23841","serial-65635"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-23840":"2020-03-18T13:24:09Z","serial-23841":"2020-03-18T13:32:34Z","serial-65635":"2025-03-08T05:36:42Z"},"title":"Полудракон","originalTitle":"Dragon Half","alt":"Полудракон OVA Dragon Half ドラゴンハーフ","description":"Минк , дочь дракона и отставного рыцаря, отправляется в путешествие, чтобы получить билеты на концерт Дика Сосера , всемирно известного кумира молодёжи и охотника на драконов. Между тем развратный король пытается взять девушку в заложники, чтобы добиться её матери, а его дочь-волшебница, разгневанная на Минк , ищет девушку, чтобы нарушить её планы.","year":1993,"type":"OVA","genres":["Комедия","Фэнтези","пародия"],"rating":6.89,"popularity":6936,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/870/5438a0cd0968fda46240f6239fc05f66.jpeg","width":420,"height":600},"backdrop":{"url":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n870-ks6pu0ThyGCJ.jpg","width":1900,"height":600}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-674","dubId":"674","label":"Люб. Одноголосый","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-23840","translation